MUSIC AND SOUND EFFECTS
  Original. Every note and every effect are synthesized in mix.py,
  _shared/audio/band.py, the scene-by-scene groove layer _shared/audio/groove.py and the cartoon effects of
  _shared/audio/toon.py (numpy/scipy), with the procedural helpers of core/audio/sfx.py. The score (MUSIC.md and
  SOUND-PLAN.md, "Rewind Pond Hop") uses the synthesized pizzicato strings, bassoon, ukulele, flute, celesta, harp,
  clarinet, xylophone, marimba, vibraphone, toy piano, steel drum, piano, muted trumpet, trumpet, trombone, toy horn,
  accordion, kazoo, tuba, glockenspiel and percussion voices of band.py / groove.py. The dragonfly wing hum, the frog
  croaks and the "raspberry" are synthesized in mix.py.
  No samples, loops or recordings by third parties.

